      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps? what steps? there's no path back to the life i had. it feels like the system is designed to crush people like me for even trying to be decent. it's just a cycle of misery and isolation. i look at the world and i just see this broken, hollow place that doesn't want anyone with a conscience. i'm just so tired of fighting for a world that clearly doesn't want me in it. it feels like the most logical thing would be to just stop trying.",
